Scripts/compile-shims/javax/ejb/ contains minimal, hand-written stand-ins for three
javax.ejb types (SessionBean, SessionContext, EJBException). They exist only so that
EJB-flavoured generator output can be COMPILED in the test suite without an EJB
container on the classpath; they are never loaded at run time and contain no code
from any Jakarta EE or Java EE implementation.
